      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOOKED ON WINNING NZ (7) scored at his last run just three days ago over 1720m at Young, getting home by 30 metres. Drawn to enjoy a cosy run but might need things to go his way at some stage. Tackles a similar assignment and he can get the job done. BROOKLYN BANDIT (1) has been racing well, placing in two of three starts since a Eugowra win. Should get every chance from the ace draw. JESSIE LEE (10) settled close to the pace and kept finding but could only manage second last start over 1740m at West Wyalong, that effort coming on the back of a sound second at this track the run before. Not drawn to best so may need a 10/10 drive. Meets a comparable field and she can play a big role. STUDLEIGH STARLITE (3) is the next elect off a last-start win by 6 metres at Dubbo over 1720m. BURRABADINE BULLET (2) was not beaten far last start when third over 1720m at Dubbo. Ready to peak third-up from a spell.",
